00:02:22.543 --> 00:02:23.539
Piercing holes?

00:02:23.539 --> 00:02:25.211
- It's hair on fire. That's what it is.

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:26.395
- Is it a body part?

00:02:26.395 --> 00:02:28.735
- Burnt hair and burnt milk.

00:02:28.955 --> 00:02:30.094
- Done.

00:02:30.434 --> 00:02:31.109
- Easy.

00:02:31.109 --> 00:02:32.037
