00:02:32.757 --> 00:02:33.525
- Is it pizza?

00:02:33.525 --> 00:02:34.892
Why does pizza smell like garbage?

00:02:34.892 --> 00:02:35.461
- Yeah!

00:02:35.461 --> 00:02:35.964
- Oh, she's right?

00:02:36.614 --> 00:02:37.368
- Oh, great!

00:02:37.368 --> 00:02:38.948
- Dude, you are so good at this.

00:02:38.948 --> 00:02:40.468
- I have a really great nose, y'all.

00:02:40.468 --> 00:02:40.771
- Wow.

00:02:40.771 --> 00:02:43.461
