to eat pizza ever again.

00:02:43.461 --> 00:02:46.260
- I would not eat a pizza
that smelled like that.

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:46.961
(laughs)

00:02:47.851 --> 00:02:49.207
- You guys are so weird.

00:02:50.256 --> 00:02:52.136
- [Voiceover] Gavon, was
today a good day or a bad day?

00:02:52.136 --> 00:02:52.739
(groans)

00:02:52.739 --> 00:02:54.122
