00:02:59.686 --> 00:03:01.836
- David Bowie died over the weekend,

00:03:01.836 --> 00:03:04.044
and everybody's still
pretty bummed out about it.

00:03:04.044 --> 00:03:06.461
But, the plus side, all
of the memorializing,

00:03:06.461 --> 00:03:10.361
people had remembered that
he had a stellar film career,

00:03:10.361 --> 00:03:12.914
including Labyrinth.

00:03:12.914 --> 00:03:15.001
So everybody go watch Labyrinth.

00:03:15.001 --> 00:03:17.018
RIP Goblin King.

00:03:17.276 --> 00:03:18.898
